WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
narrator: This is the historical operator CLI against a mock RPC.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.000
narrator: Container readiness is not public-chain deployment or paid-service qualification.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:13.000
narrator: The key-sealing command uses the fixture's passphrase.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:27.000
narrator: Attempt a legacy bond of one billion OU in the mock environment.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:39.000
narrator: Attempt endpoint registration; these commands can mask errors.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:50.000
narrator: Inspect the running process list.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:02:02.000
narrator: Run health checks and inspect the reported result.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:08.000
narrator: Stop the mock stack.
